#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/DFN-with-particle-size-distributions.ipynb:643
msgid ""
"<pre>\n"
"[1] Joel A. E. Andersson, Joris Gillis, Greg Horn, James B. Rawlings, and "
"Moritz Diehl. CasADi – A software framework for nonlinear optimization and "
